SMtvFKGEE\" width=\"690\" height=\"331\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/1/01df0b157b2e5de10b53d2ecbba7b6f425400d00_2_690x331.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/1/01df0b157b2e5de10b53d2ecbba7b6f425400d00_2_1035x496.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/1/01df0b157b2e5de10b53d2ecbba7b6f425400d00_2_1380x662.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F9FD\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2490×1196 113 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
