      "created_at": "2026-01-25T14:27:21.420Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, you can do this.<br>\nPlease go to <strong>Desktop Icon List</strong> and add a <strong>New Desktop Icon</strong>, ensuring that <strong>“Is Standard”</strong> is checked.<br>\nThis may be a minor bug in <strong>Frappe</strong>.<br>\nAdditionally, you can add sidebar items from <strong>Workspace Sidebar</strong>.</p>",
